n\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/0d6a218786c3f424721f672fee957a22.webp?t=1779293266\" width=780 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/f2dc065b9ad1635caba18fd5881a0d2e.avif?t=1779293266\" width=780 height=75 /></span>Forget chrome and clean lines. This tower is brutalist, broken, and boiling with tension. Cracked concrete, busted wiring, and flickering warnings paint every floor. You’ll push through steam-choked factories, collapsed medical bays, and decayed corporate labs. It’s gritty, dense, and worn in the best way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/ec3c8d081ccc6bf433b0aaff21482291.poster.avif?t=1779293266\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/ec3c8d081ccc6bf433b0aaff21482291.webm?t=1779293266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/ec3c8d081ccc6bf433b0aaff21482291.mp4?t=1779293266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "SunderBound is a co-op top-down shooter with roguelite progression, set in a crumbling mega-tower. Survive floor by floor with a partner you trust, or an AI companion if you’re climbing solo. Every room’s a test. Every upgrade’s earned. And the only way out is up.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/bde23b664c1b63c683a877dcf064c7a48a5c8cae/header.jpg?t=1779293266", "cap